\f0\fs24 \cf2 <$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Dr Kathy Logan went among the Elvi. It wasn\'92t hard to find candidates for her research; they were mostly in the act of heeding the words of the Great Teacher as she encountered them, and encountering them was a public doddle. \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
She attended parties at Chanta\'92s penthouse, though Hayley refused to attend. As the days progressed, the bolder she got. The less said about what she collected, and how, is probably the better, though suffice to say she became emboldened to forgo the asking permission part. Her standard warnings of, \'93Medical research, coming through\'94 and \'93Hold still. You will feel a small prick,\'94 were generally considered insufficient and, at the very least, ambiguous. That is, until the \'93volunteer\'94 recognised her as Holy Aunt Kathy. Mostly, they just got on with the rhythm of what they were doing and hardly missed a beat.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 Each morning, Kathy returned to Sublime Point with samples on a cover-copt that had, by then, become on permanent stand-by. The word spread of Holy Aunt Kathy\'92s tireless work to find a cure for the lurgy afflicting the Elvi.\
By the third day, Elvi queued at medical centres and and surgeries through the Ghetto to contribute blood samples for the effort. As Kathy became swamped with samples, Eloise reassigned a dozen researchers from a bioweapons lab elsewhere in the underground Ruined Castle sprawl\'97a project she casually described to Kathy as \'93how to regulate itches that eat people alive.\'94 Kathy assumed the project was concerned with how to deploy a thing that already existed. The new staff immediately took to managing as many diagnostic instruments as they could unpack. Even so, the samples coming back from the Ghetto were overwhelming.\
Hayley led a team of data mechanics and scientologists to compile the specimen data and test results, and integrate it with the identity nodes in Parliament\'92s humpological database. (Rumours that a meta-science of hump-ontology grew out of this work have never been verified.)\
Kathy \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 she tried not to wince about how generous Chanta had been with his sample donations, and processed them \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
first. \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 As she suspected, the digital PCR measured  extremely high levels of Chilli floating in his cells. She quickly confirmed he was nearer to Patient Zero than anyone else, or perhaps Patient Zero himself. Kathy\'92s mind wobbled through a few dimensions for a moment, and she wondered if she\'92d bungled her patch dosage. There could be others. Kathy would have to look for others, knowing that if she found none, that would still not prove that Chanta was the only source. If he was the only source, then he was irritatingly right about launching the Humpenings\'97sexual transmission was an obvious candidate transmission vector.\
The place to look for other sources would be among those with the highest levels of Chilli and their sexual relation graphs. They\'92d all either link back to Chanta, or they would not. The samples she was obtaining from Chanta\'92s parties would likely be the most illuminating (assuming Chanta couldn\'92t possible entertain 
\f2\i all 
\f1\i0 his guests to the same level of attention).\
She\'92d need to start DNA sequencing. Fine; she\'92d always intended to anyway. Again, she started with Chanta\'92s samples, even the underwear he\'92d offered. The sequencer binged for attention; Kathy tapped up the results. She nearly left off her stool. She looked again.\
Chilli had integrated into Chanta\'92s DNA.\
She rotated the displayed section of the complex molecule and boggled at it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 If Hayley was reluctant to join Kathy on her bacchanalian field trips, she was a trooper in compiling the data. As \'93Holy Aunt Hayley\'94, and with the assistance of the Elvi Parliament and the High Elvis himself, she distributed a census through the Ghetto that asked one key question: 
\f2\i Who have you humped in the previous twelve months?
\f1\i0  Campaigns went out on the anti-social media platforms and, since they contained the keywords 
\fs20 ELVI, DEATH, 
\fs22 and 
\fs20 HUMPING
\f2\i , 
\f1\i0\fs22 they went straight to the top of every Elvi\'92s feed. And since it had come from Holy Aunt Hayley, all took solemn notice of the campaigns\'92 instructions to be accurate about the information they shared in the census.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 Kathy automated the querying of HumpoDB (\'93humpological database\'94 quickly became too tiresome) to quickly show the nodes between one record and Chanta\'92s. She also built queries to find graphs where Chanta was not the source. Hayley worked from the supposition these were incomplete, and organised investigations to complete the picture. \
To begin with, Kathy saw what she expected; the highest concentrations of Chilli were present in Elvisettes and those Elvi who had received Chanta\'92s blessing personally. It took a little filtering and pivoting of the data to make everything fit. Kathy had an answer, but she would need to conduct longitudinal studies to confirm it. Those would take weeks or months. Kathy applied a new patch and sat alone in an office while it took effect. She thought through her hunch again and still couldn\'92t find any holes in it.\
When present as a free-floating virus, Chilli diminished over time. This, she could extrapolate from the data. The were fewer records of partners having sex with Chanta six months ago, from before he became the Great Teacher, than recent records. That made sense; there was no doubt Chanta was getting more  offers and opportunities than in his entire life before. And the earlier the events those records reported, the less concentrated was Chilli. Over time, without a \'93re-blessing\'94 from Chanta, the recipients\'92 levels of Chilli dwindled, to the point that records of six-month-old, non-recurrent sexually activity exhibited no Chilli at all. Though records of even older events were fewer and sketchier, they showed an absence of Chilli  too.\
Kathy had answers.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0
