That meant that either Pickle needed to be eradicated, or the Elvi would need to be regularly inoculated against it for the rest of their lives.\
Kathy lay on the couch she\'92d been sitting on and rested the back of her hand on her forehead. Of this Kathy was sure: Pickle and Chilli had been engineered as a pair. It was an act of Latter Day Capitalism in its purest form: introduce a deadly virus for which the only treatment was the same intellectual property as the virus. Pickle need only be released once, or at most once a generation, to propagate the fear of it and create dependence on Chilli for life.\
Except, somehow in Chanta had managed to get Chilli in his DNA. That was not the work of Latter Day Capitalism. Something had gone wrong\'97perhaps an accident, or a drug designer with a conscience.\
Kathy instantly took to her feet. Now she\'92d have to wait for the patch to wear off before she could reliably reason through her fear.\
Both Pickle 
\f2\i and 
\f1\i0  Chilli needed to be eradicated.
